  description: 'When a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated while you
    control a "Vaalmonica" Link Monster: Negate the activation, and if you do, destroy
    that card. You can banish this card from your GY; shuffle into the Deck, "Vaalmonica"
    cards from your face-up Extra Deck, GY, and/or banishment, except "Vaalmonica
    Ereditare", up to the number of Resonance Counters on your field, then you can
    draw 1 card for every 3 cards shuffled. You can only use 1 "Vaalmonica Ereditare"
    effect per turn, and only once that turn.'
